{"id": "EUVD-2026-99255", "enisaUuid": "05bb6c8b-52d3-3f7b-af25-8e3af518e958", "description": "Snowy 3.6.5 contains a hard-coded HMAC key vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to forge download signatures for the /dev/file/download endpoint by using the published FILE_DOWNLOAD_SIGN_SECRET constant. Attackers can compute HMAC-SHA256 signatures of guessed file ids offline to download stored files such as avatars, editor images and attachments.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:50:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T19:23:28", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/snowy-dev-file-access-control", "https://github.com/xiaonuobase/Snowy/blob/v3.6.5/snowy-plugin/snowy-plugin-dev/src/main/java/vip/xiaonuo/dev/modular/file/service/impl/DevFileServiceImpl.java#L419-L445", "https://github.com/xiaonuobase/Snowy/blob/v3.6.5/snowy-plugin/snowy-plugin-dev/src/main/java/vip/xiaonuo/dev/modular/file/service/impl/DevFileServiceImpl.java#L78", "https://github.com/xiaonuobase/Snowy/blob/v3.6.5/snowy-web-app/src/main/java/vip/xiaonuo/core/config/GlobalConfigure.java#L174-L175", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/snowy-3.6.5-hard-coded-download-signature-key-allows-unauthenticated-file-download"], "aliases": ["GHSA-jq4c-83mm-g2wr", "CVE-2026-110214"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.46, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1b9ee002-6c61-385f-8688-18fd10ba2111", "product": {"name": "Snowy", "vendor": {"name": "themerex"}}, "product_version": "3.6.5 \u22643.6.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "034c9be1-fad8-3dde-bc4a-216a49974964", "vendor": {"name": "xiaonuobase"}}], "isExploited": false}